# Copy this file to engine/test/.audit_private_terms (it is never committed)
# and list the things that must never be published, one pattern per line.
# Case doesn't matter. Lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Your school's name and its short form:
# example academy
# \bEXA\b
#
# Your town or city, if it would identify the school:
# lakeside
#
# Your computer's user name (it shows up in file paths):
# yourwindowsname
#
# The names of private repos or folders:
# my-private-repo
#
# Your own email address:
# you@yourschool\.example
